# S22a, member b (k10, replaying at most 300 steps a second): with a west; stays when a leaves; follows at @322 s:
# a JOIN of a's stag0102 instance (about 50 s of ticks, a catch-up of about 12 s), whose only member leaves the
# stage meanwhile: b falls back to NEW in stag0102.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@91
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
route {route:stag0101_west:-280,-190}
wander -280 -190 6 until present=1 fail stagechange
log a left
wander -280 -190 6 until epoch>=@322 fail stagechange
log b follows
mat matz02 yes until stage=stag0102,control
log in stag0102 on its own
idle until frames>=600
